      "content": "i'm not trying to be dramatic, i just mean that staying here feels like a lie. everyone keeps telling me to \"reach out\" or \"get help\" like there's some way to go back to being one of them, but that version of me died a long time ago. doesn't it seem weird that everyone's so obsessed with staying in a world that's this empty? it feels like people are just afraid of the silence.",
